<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to withdraw from Parramatta Park an area
of land, being the site of the old Government House; to provide for the care,
control and management of that land and to appoint The National Trust of
Australia (New South Wales) as trustee thereof; to amend the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Lands
Consolidation Act 1913</i></name></legref>, <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>The National Trust of Australia (New
South Wales) Act 1960</i></name></legref> and certain other Acts; and for
purposes connected therewith.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5f78b911-6a3a-4b2e-af43-3823cd90be91"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_c480c218-495a-489e-96f7-1db6c5f12e8c"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1967-033"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Parramatta Park (Old Government House) Act
1967</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7c385453-cb41-403e-864f-c90d2c297220"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_31b49219-1905-4191-828a-525d6c4cd85e"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, unless the context or subject matter
otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1b461748-0b13-40eb-a5c8-e870a4c80c21"
id="def.NationalTrust"><b><i>National Trust</i></b></defterm> means The
National Trust of Australia (New South Wales) constituted and incorporated
under <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>The National Trust of Australia (New South Wales) Act
1960</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b5289f5a-c0de-4c8f-a4be-7ac0fac32fef"
id="def.PrincipalAct"><b><i>Principal Act</i></b></defterm> means the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Lands
Consolidation Act 1913</i></name></legref>, as amended by subsequent
Acts.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_de04e005-2673-4c42-9f62-90dc8ec783c5" id="def.theland"><b><i>the
land</i></b></defterm> means the land described in the Schedule and any
buildings, structures or other improvements thereon.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d220b0e8-78f1-453b-8421-92535b1ed91d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_0698414f-29cd-4e35-bf5b-5f6677e71ef6"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Divesting and rededicating of the land</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3f748ead-5fa6-40bf-95e2-5d3c18d5f337"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The land is hereby vested in Her Majesty freed
and discharged from any trusts, estates, interests, dedications, conditions,
restrictions, covenants and provisions affecting the
land</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_85ed9e67-7530-43a2-a5d8-b084b76f5af1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The land shall be deemed to be Crown land and to
be dedicated under the Principal Act for the preservation of the land and the
old Government House and other buildings on the land as a historical site and
historical buildings.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3c13bab7-a231-470f-abe5-bec007f68cec"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_0848d5cb-c5ab-444f-b245-c7178f502446"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Appointment of trustee</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The National Trust shall be the trustee of the
land, and, notwithstanding the provisions of section 5, shall be deemed to
have been appointed under subsection (1) of section 26 of the Principal
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f0347b74-2fb9-4d0f-8d8c-28cae2c29333"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_8c2f591e-d464-4e01-9f73-f0c567083b89"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Application of Principal Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Such provisions of the Principal Act (other than
subsections (1), (1A), (1B), (1D) and (1E) of section 26) as relate to Crown
lands dedicated under section 24 of the Principal Act and to trustees thereof
shall apply to and in respect of the land and the National Trust as trustee of
the land.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6fa01e62-c2ff-4b51-acf6-f00cf99499c8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_2e9340ca-9b2f-4212-b1b4-33a1eaccdf05"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Application of <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>The National Trust of Australia (NSW)
Act 1960</i></name></legref></b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any provisions of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_88c0a4d7-66f3-4052-b727-f69c0dbfbbe7" id="sec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>The National Trust of Australia (New
South Wales) Act 1960</i></name></legref> which permit, in accordance with
that Act:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0d6c3a78-d1b9-4c47-954f-373f6cbae8f2" id="sec.6-para1.a-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the selling, exchanging, leasing, mortgaging or
other disposal of land,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1ee4ff78-433f-40c5-9eae-046aa401f973" id="sec.6-para1.a-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the making of by-laws,
or</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_042dabbf-239a-4964-b6ea-eb32eb5a0605" id="sec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any by-laws made under that
Act,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">shall not apply to or in respect of the
land.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fa7b6d5d-647f-48b0-aa5e-17081d54b44f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_469619f5-c4b1-48c6-a84c-6bf6ff9758da"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Access through Parramatta Park</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12416e75-658b-4480-8afd-f91faa07611b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Members, officers, employees and servants of the
National Trust, and the other persons lawfully authorised by the National
Trust or its members, officers, employees or servants, for all purposes of the
National Trust (and in particular as trustee of the land), and persons
lawfully visiting the land, may go to and from the land, over Parramatta Park
or any part thereof, at such times, in such manner and subject to such
conditions:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a78d26f5-6e66-4213-9d00-662b772fd9b1" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as may be arranged by agreement from time to time
between the National Trust and the trustees or any person or body of persons
in which the care, control and management of Parramatta Park may be vested,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9e88901d-d8fb-45fd-a351-a843d4fa675a" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">failing such agreement, as may be determined by
the Minister.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6d2b7519-2e02-4e9a-bb10-4a4a27d0a72e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The provisions of subsection (1) shall apply
notwithstanding the provisions of any other Act, or of any rules, regulations,
by-laws or ordinances, applying in respect of Parramatta
Park.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8678d501-85de-479f-9755-1c53b5460806"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (1) and to any agreement or
determination under that subsection, the provisions referred to in subsection
(2) shall continue to apply in respect of Parramatta Park in all other
respects.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1e562bb7-9151-4830-873b-9e7316ae0fae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_53356bbb-6ae7-484c-bf51-7a96d4ae9990"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Use of the land</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to this Act, the National Trust as
trustee of the land may use the land for such purposes as the Minister may
from time to time approve.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5fb10aa9-62ce-4b9a-9b71-71a399193c0a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_ca996ae3-ae16-479f-9131-d171baa4f2ee"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Debts, liabilities and actions to
continue</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act affects any debts owing or
liabilities incurred or actions which were or might have been commenced,
before the commencement of this Act, in respect of the land or of anything
done or omitted to be done in connection therewith.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="schedules">

<level type="schedule" id="sch">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="type" value="schedule"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d4124193-d26d-4768-b555-9aa8bae2af6e"></attrib>
