<head>
<no><b>Schedule</b></no></head>
<block align="right" type="sourceref"><txt>Section 2</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">ALL that piece or parcel of land containing by
admeasurement 2 acres 0 roods 23 perches be the same more or less situate in
the Town of Parramatta, Parish of St. John, County of Cumberland, being
portion 369 commencing at a point bearing 297 degrees 16 minutes 456 feet 9
inches from the most northerly north-western corner of portion 362 and bounded
thence on the south-west by lines successively bearing 292 degrees 8 minutes
157 feet 10 1/4 inches and 275 degrees 9 minutes 30 seconds 175 feet 6 1/8
inches, again on the south-west by a line bearing 353 degrees 3 minutes 77
feet 9 1/2 inches, on the north-west by a line bearing 55 degrees 41 minutes
291 feet 8 3/8 inches, on the north-east by lines successively bearing 93
degrees 3 minutes 83 feet 7 5/8 inches, 113 degrees 33 minutes 55 feet 1 1/8
inches and 139 degrees 57 minutes 30 seconds 102 feet 3 7/8 inches, and on the
south-east by lines successively bearing 185 degrees 34 minutes 30 seconds 175
feet 1 inch and 247 degrees 54 minutes 30 seconds 100 feet 7 5/8 inches to the
point of commencement, and being also the whole of the land shown on plan
catalogued C9290&#8211;2030 in the Department of Lands,
Sydney.</txt></block></level>
</content>


